      "description": "Amid widespread job losses in cognitive professions and growing unrest, a transnational movement of displaced knowledge workers organizes under the banner 'Human Futures', demanding AI taxation to fund universal basic income and retraining. The movement gains traction in EU cities, staging coordinated protests and digital strikes. It pressures governments to act, framing AI not just as a technological shift but a social contract rupture.",
